Grammar

    0 $accept: programme $end

    1 programme: TOK_ANNEE TOK_STRING liste_niveaux

    2 liste_niveaux: niveau
    3              | liste_niveaux niveau

    4 $@1: ε

    5 niveau: TOK_NIVEAU TOK_ID_NIVEAU $@1 '{' liste_etudiants '}'

    6 liste_etudiants: etudiant
    7                | liste_etudiants etudiant

    8 etudiant: TOK_ETUDIANT '{' TOK_MATRICULE ':' TOK_STRING TOK_NOM ':' TOK_STRING TOK_PRENOM ':' TOK_STRING liste_semestres '}'
    9         | TOK_ETUDIANT '{' error '}'

   10 liste_semestres: semestre
   11                | liste_semestres semestre

   12 semestre: TOK_SEMESTRE TOK_ID_SEM '{' liste_modules '}'

   13 liste_modules: module
   14              | liste_modules module

   15 module: TOK_MODULE TOK_STRING TOK_COEF TOK_ENTIER TOK_NOTE valeur_note

   16 valeur_note: TOK_REEL
   17            | TOK_ENTIER


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    ':' (58) 8
    '{' (123) 5 8 9 12
    '}' (125) 5 8 9 12
    error (256) 9
    TOK_ANNEE (258) 1
    TOK_NIVEAU (259) 5
    TOK_ETUDIANT (260) 8 9
    TOK_MATRICULE (261) 8
    TOK_NOM (262) 8
    TOK_PRENOM (263) 8
    TOK_SEMESTRE (264) 12
    TOK_MODULE (265) 15
    TOK_COEF (266) 15
    TOK_NOTE (267) 15
    TOK_ID_NIVEAU <str> (268) 5
    TOK_ID_SEM <str> (269) 12
    TOK_STRING <str> (270) 1 8 15
    TOK_ENTIER <entier> (271) 15 17
    TOK_REEL <reel> (272) 16


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (21)
        on left: 0
    programme <programme> (22)
        on left: 1
        on right: 0
    liste_niveaux <niveau> (23)
        on left: 2 3
        on right: 1 3
    niveau <niveau> (24)
        on left: 5
        on right: 2 3
    $@1 (25)
        on left: 4
        on right: 5
    liste_etudiants <etudiant> (26)
        on left: 6 7
        on right: 5 7
    etudiant <etudiant> (27)
        on left: 8 9
        on right: 6 7
    liste_semestres <semestre> (28)
        on left: 10 11
        on right: 8 11
    semestre <semestre> (29)
        on left: 12
        on right: 10 11
    liste_modules <module> (30)
        on left: 13 14
        on right: 12 14
    module <module> (31)
        on left: 15
        on right: 13 14
    valeur_note <reel> (32)
        on left: 16 17
        on right: 15


State 0

    0 $accept: • programme $end

    TOK_ANNEE  shift, and go to state 1

    programme  go to state 2


State 1

    1 programme: TOK_ANNEE • TOK_STRING liste_niveaux

    TOK_STRING  shift, and go to state 3


State 2

